ding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8a/dg80m0kcg8wa9h365tpmkm8p5rr3tbb.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%86%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/8a/dg80m0kcg8wa9h365tpmkm8p5rr3tbb.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />凛冬庇护\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[反应]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（反应）攻击拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼移动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼移动</font></span></span>]或[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼速度\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">▼速度</font></span></span>]的敌人时，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰铠\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">冰铠</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。被拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼移动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼移动</font></span></span>]或[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼速度\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">▼速度</font></span></span>]的敌人主动攻击时，受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%A6%AE%E8%92%82%E5%A8%85\" title=\"角色图鉴